            "review_text": "Escape67430265691\n1 contribution\n0\nPate 10 points\nMay 2026 • Solo\nI am a patate lover, so the first thing I notice when eating bread is patate. In Bali, flavorful and fatty patates in their own style - unlike industrial containers, there is something very handmade and characteristic. The cake can look simple but the taste is harmonious, eating still remembers the smell of butter and paste. This is the type of restaurant that I will find once I return.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten May 24, 2026\nTuan N\nCảm ơn bạn nhiều nha ❤️\nPate bên mình làm theo kiểu mộc mạc, giữ vị truyền thống nên được bạn thích tụi mình vui lắm. Có dịp quay lại Đà Nẵng nhớ ghé Bà Lan ăn tiếp nha 😊\nRead more\nWritten May 26, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
