            "review_text": "Departure63890600171\n1 contribution\n0\nEastern without having to wait long – fast service rewarding\nSep 2025 • Solo\nAt high hour on Sunday morning, the restaurant was so crowded that I thought I had to wait half an hour. The food grows fast and still keeps warm. The bread is hot as soon as you bring it, eating in a better place than you think. The general feeling is that the restaurant has a pretty paper service process even though it carries a completely local style.\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten May 20, 2026\nTuan N\nCảm ơn bạn nhiều nha ❤️\nCuối tuần quán đông nên tụi mình vui lắm khi bạn vẫn có trải nghiệm thoải mái. Bà Lan luôn cố gắng làm nhanh nhưng vẫn giữ bánh nóng giòn khi tới tay khách 😊\nCảm ơn bạn đã để ý tới cách phục vụ của quán. Hẹn bạn ghé lại ăn bánh mì nóng tiếp nha 👍\nRead more\nWritten May 26, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
