            "review_text": "ZKhang1\n2 contributions\n0\nThe real fat, the real fat doesn't go out.\nMay 2026 • Solo\nI went to the restaurant early in the morning, and the restaurant had a lot of guests. Calling a meat bread, picking up the first bite is to immediately feel the true crust of the pie shell - crusty from the outside into the inside rather than crusty surface and soft inside. The moderate fat paté, characteristic flavor, eats a whole bowl without even seeing it. This is exactly the type of bread I’m looking for every time I go.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten May 20, 2026\nTuan N\nCảm ơn bạn nhiều nha ❤️\nĐọc review mà tụi mình vui lắm luôn 😊 Bánh mì bên mình luôn cố gắng giữ nóng giòn, còn pate thì làm theo kiểu béo vừa để ăn hết ổ vẫn thấy ngon miệng.\nRất vui vì Bà Lan đã thành một trong những vị bánh mì bạn nhớ khi tới Đà Nẵng. Hẹn gặp lại bạn nha 👍\nRead more\nWritten May 26, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
